  2/5
  Requires secondary mechanism - near-midline neck
  entry needs temporary cavity or fragmentation to
  breach both pleural spaces
  2/5
  Requires -35 cm wound track from neck to T2-T3
  level, or hemorrhage tracking along fascial planes from
